    "diagnosis": "Geographical seroprevalence of KSHV/HHV8",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The KSHV/HHV8 seroprevalence in sub-Saharan Africa (&gt;&nbsp;40%) is significantly higher than in northern Europe, Asia, and the USA (&lt;&nbsp;10%). However, distributions vary regionally both in Africa and in Europe: in southern Italy, including Sicily and Sardinia, the seroprevalence is significantly higher (intermediate levels of 10&ndash;30%) (figure modified from {30705286}).",
    "source": "",
